        "happened": "keyv 6.0.0 is published at 09:35 UTC with a new preinstall script, node setup.mjs. It still carries valid provenance from GitHub Actions, the trusted publisher.",
        "shows": "The grave turns Possessed. An install script appeared that earlier versions did not have. Provenance alone would not have flagged it."
      }
